The Following is a list of ToolTypes for this ICON:


NOTICE: ALL TOOLTYPES ARE CASE SENSITIVE


ABOUT: This ICON is required to be in the BBS directory
       This defines your conferences.


NCONFS=
NAME.X=
LOCATION.X=
RELATIVE_CONFERENCES


NCONFS= <number of conferences>

         -Version 3.0
         -REQUIRED
         -tells /X the number of conferences your BBS has.
         -Current Limit is 9.

     NCONFS=9


NAME.X= <name of conference>

         -Version 3.0
         -REQUIRED
         -tells /X the name of conference (X).

     NAME.1=VALIDATION

LOCATION.X= <location of conference>

         -Version 3.0
         -REQUIRED
         -tells /X the location of conference (X).
         -if the location is a directory, then the location must have a
          '/' appended to the end of the directory name.

     LOCATION.1=BBS:Validation/


RELATIVE_CONFERENCES

         -Version 3.0
         -OPTIONAL
         -tells /X to only show user accessible conferences, vs. showing
          all conferences on the system.
         -ie: If a user elects to join conference #3, he will actually join
              the 3rd conference he/she has access to.

     RELATIVE_CONFERENCES


